    <summary>Intelligent, multilingual recipe management for Nextcloud</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
SmartCook is a self-hosted recipe manager with structured ingredients, tags, automatic import from URLs or text, optional AI extraction, OCR adapters, meal planning, shopping lists, sharing, history and exports.
